{%- comment -%}
  Inner contents of the header's cart link (#cart-icon-bubble).

  This section is re-rendered through the Section Rendering API and written
  straight into that link's innerHTML on every cart change -- by cart.js,
  cart-drawer.js, cart-notification.js, quick-add-bulk.js and
  quick-order-list.js. Dawn's stock version emits an SVG cart icon plus a
  count bubble, which replaced the "Bag - N" pill contents the moment anything
  was added to or removed from the cart, so the pill reverted to an icon.

  It therefore has to mirror the markup in sections/header.liquid exactly.
  The <a> wrapper itself (and its .ct-bag class) is not re-rendered -- only
  what is inside it -- so only the inner spans belong here.

  If the pill markup in sections/header.liquid changes, change it here too.
{%- endcomment -%}
<span class="ct-bag__label">{{ 'sections.header.ct_bag_label' | t }}</span>
<span aria-hidden="true">&nbsp;&middot;&nbsp;</span>
<span aria-hidden="true">{{ cart.item_count }}</span>
<span class="visually-hidden">{{ 'sections.header.cart_count' | t: count: cart.item_count }}</span>
